remove .env.example and create .env with the following content:

TURSO_DATABASE_URL="add your turso database url here"
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN="add your turso auth token here"
DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-chat
DEEPSEEK_BASE_URL=https://api.deepseek.com
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN="add your telegram bot token here"
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY="add your deepseek api key here"